    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stracomer Hill has a well deserved reputation for top quality houses which are perfectly located only a few minutes from either Tullan Strand ( a 2 kilometre stretch of golden sand and one of the best surf beaches in Ireland) or Bundoran Town Centre. \nNo 25, built in 2007 is a spacious detached home with tarmac surfaced parking for a number of cars to the front and a west facing rear garden. Measuring almost 2000 square feet, internal accommodation comprises of a sitting room with vaulted ceiling, large kitchen/dining room, utility room, three large bedrooms (all en-suite) plus main bathroom. Featuring underfloor heating, concrete floors between ground and first floor and oak timber finish throughout, this high specification home has lots of appeal."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Spacious three bedroom detached home<br><br>\nEntrance Hall - 7.7m x 2.3m <br>Tiled floor.\nReturn style stairs to first floor.\nFront door with glass side panels.\nSide window.\nTwo ornate ceiling lights.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.7m x 4.0m <br>Double height ceiling.\nTwo windows to front.\nTall window to side.\nOpen fire with marble fireplace.\nOak floor.\nTwo ceiling lights.\nDoor leading into kitchen/dining room.<br><br><br>\nKitchen/Dining Room - 7.5m x 4.0m <br>High and low level units with polished stone worktops.\nCentre island unit with breakfast counter.\nRangemaster cooker.\nIntegrated fridge freezer.\nIntegrated dishwasher.\nTwo bowl stainless steel sink.\nChrome extractor hood.\nLarge corner window, south and west facing.\nSecond window at sink.\nPVC back door with glass side panel.\nTiled floor.\nRecessed ceiling lights.<br><br><br>\nUtility Room - 2.7m x 2.7m <br>High and low level kitchen units.\nStainless steel sink.\nPlumbed for washing.\nWalk-in cupboard.\nBack door opening onto paved area.\nWindow.<br><br><br>\nWC - 1.5m x 1.5m <br>Access from Utility Room.\nWHB & WC.\nFloor tiled and walls fully tiled.\nWindow.<br><br><br>\nDownstairs Bedroom - 4.0m x 3.0m <br>Oak floor.\nFront facing window.\n<br><br><br>\nEn-suite - 3.0m x 1.0m <br>WHB, WC and large shower unit.\nFloor and walls fully tiled.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 6.0m x 3.0m <br>Oak floor.\nDual aspect windows.<br><br><br>\nEn-suite - 2.8m x 1.4m <br>WHB, WC and quadrant shower unit.\nFloor and walls fully tiled.\nVelux window.\n<br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 5.2m x 4.0m <br>Oak floor.\nDual aspect windows.\nBuilt-in wardrobe.<br><br><br>\nEn-suite - 2.7m x 2.0m <br>Max. Measurement.\nWHB,WC and shower.\nFloor and walls fully tiled.\n.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 4.0m x 2.0m <br>WHB,WC & Bath (Jacuzzi).\nFloor and walls fully tiled.\nElectric chrome heated towel rail.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Within a few minutes walk of Tullan Strand and Bundoran Town Centre\nThree en-suite bedrooms including one ground floor bedroom.\nUnderfloor heating.\nConcrete floor between ground and first floor.\nOak doors, skirtings and architraves.\nTarmac surfaced parking area to front.\nPaved area to rear."
      },
      {
